  basicDesc: Draco Drift
  scanDesc: 'Draco runs an underground LLC recognized as "Night Wire." The business
    focuses on a variety of media, including illegal biomodifications and chip modding/install
    software.


    They recommended Cipher his doctor for the install he had. The
    contact was referred to as "a friend of a friend".


    The source was supposedly
    claimed to be safe. Any wider knowledge does not argue against this.'
  reportInfoDesc: "Drift, Dragomir \"Draco\" \n35 years old\n\"Freelancer\"\nOriginally
    from the Anvil\n\nA guest at the party. Claims to be a 'friend' of the victim.\n\ntestimonies
    state they were outside the building smoking a pipe nearby another attendee during
    the afterparty. They only reentered after the commotion revolving around the
    deceased."
